<SAMI>
<HEAD>
<TITLE>Bakery Tour</TITLE>
<STYLE TYPE="text/css">
<!--
P { margin-left:8pt; margin-right:8pt; font-size:20pt; text-align:center;
    font-family:굴림, Arial; color:white; background-color:black; }
.KRCC { Name:한국어; lang:ko-KR; SAMIType:CC; }
.ENCC { Name:English; lang:en-US; SAMIType:CC; }
.FRCC { Name:Français; lang:fr-FR; SAMIType:CC; }
-->
</STYLE>
</HEAD>
<BODY>
<SYNC Start=1000><P Class=KRCC>빵집은 아침 여섯 시에 문을 엽니다.
<SYNC Start=1000><P Class=ENCC>The bakery opens at six in the morning.
<SYNC Start=1000><P Class=FRCC>La boulangerie ouvre à six heures du matin.
<SYNC Start=4200><P Class=KRCC>&nbsp;
<SYNC Start=4200><P Class=ENCC>&nbsp;
<SYNC Start=4200><P Class=FRCC>&nbsp;
<!-- Part 2 -->
<SYNC Start=5000><P Class=KRCC>오늘은 <font color="#ffff00">비</font>가 옵니다.<br>우산을 챙기세요.
<SYNC Start=5000><P Class=ENCC>It is <font color="#ffff00">raining</font> today.<br>Take an umbrella.
<SYNC Start=5000><P Class=FRCC>Il <font color=yellow>pleut</font> aujourd'hui.<br>Prenez un parapluie.
<SYNC Start=8000><P Class=KRCC><B>기차</B>가 곧 출발합니다.<P Class=ENCC><I>The train</I> leaves soon.<P Class=FRCC><U>Le train</U> part bientôt.
<SYNC Start=10500>&nbsp;
<SYNC Start=11000><P Class=ENCC>Bread &amp; coffee cost less than 5 euros.
<SYNC Start=13000><P Class=ENCC>&nbsp;
</BODY>
</SAMI>
